{
  "title": "Nitro Charred Tunisian Chickpeas Casserole",
  "description": "A smoky, flaky vegan chickpea casserole infused with Tunisian spices, topped with a crisp nitro crust and finished in a clay pot for a hearty meal‑prep option.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
