      "amount": "1 tbsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "vegan parmesan",
      "amount": "1/4 cup"
    },
    {
      "name": "vegetable broth",
      "amount": "1/2 cup"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200°C.",
    "Toss chickpeas with olive oil, smoked paprika, cumin, coriander, salt, pepper, and harissa until well coated.",
    "Spread chickpeas on a baking sheet and roast for 20 minutes, stirring halfway, until edges are charred.",
    "Transfer roasted chickpeas to a clay pot, add lemon juice, and mix.",
    "Stir in vegetable broth, nutritional yeast, and vegan parmesan until creamy.",
    "Cover the clay pot with parchment paper or foil and bake for 15 minutes.",
    "Remove the cover, stir, and bake another 10 minutes until the top forms a crisp crust.",
    "Let the casserole rest for 5 minutes, then sprinkle toasted sesame seeds and serve."
  ],
